OpenDiscordBot
==============

A small, general-purpose discord.js v14 bot. Requires Node.js 22.12 or newer.

Setup
-----

git clone https://github.com/wired420/OpenDiscordBot.git
cd OpenDiscordBot
npm install
cp config.json-default config.json

Edit config.json with your bot token, client id, your user id and any other
settings. In the Discord Developer Portal, enable the "Message Content" intent
for the bot (needed for the ! prefix commands).

npm run deploy      # register the /slash commands with Discord (once, and after changes)
./startup.sh        # start the bot in a detached screen session
npm run dev         # or: run in the foreground, restarting on file changes

Features
--------

- Rules verification: reacting to the rules message with verifyEmoji gives verifyRoleId.
- !help, !ptt / !pushtotalk
- /everyone [message]   ping @everyone (members with the everyoneRoleName role; logged)
- /server, /whoami
- /reload               reload command files and re-register commands (owner only)
